{"id":"75dcbb9ddb4d707f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain.md","title":"ZFC Rank Initial Chain","display":"df-zfc-rank-initial-chain — ZFC Rank Initial Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain"],"display":"df-zfc-rank-initial-chain — ZFC Rank Initial Chain","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rank-initial-chain — ZFC Rank Initial Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7440ca29cd784bc\" href=\"?note=b7440ca29cd784bc\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-rank.md\">../batch10/58-df-rank.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\in V\\)</span> (rank-initial sequence candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(x)\\)</span> (rank map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7440ca29cd784bc\" href=\"?note=b7440ca29cd784bc\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RankInitialChain}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RankInitialChain}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RankInitialChain}_S(\\mathcal V,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal V,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal V))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathcal V(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\alpha\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\mathcal V(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal V(\\beta))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RankInitialChain}_S(\\mathcal V,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal V,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal V))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathcal V(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\alpha\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\mathcal V(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal V(\\beta))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>单调递增的任意集合链不一定是秩初始链；必须要求第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 项恰由秩小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的集合组成。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"b7440ca29cd784bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"b7440ca29cd784bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{rank}(x)$ (rank map, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-rank-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RankInitialChain}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RankInitialChain}_S(\\mathcal V,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal V,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal V))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\,\\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathcal V(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(x)<\\alpha\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;(\\alpha<\\beta\\to\\mathcal V(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\mathcal V(\\beta))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1327,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain.md|58-df-zfc-rank-initial-chain]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b7440ca29cd784bc","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751","39b5d097687ec105"]}